<title>POLAND: BPH JULY NET RISES TO PLN 30.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>BPH JULY NET RISES TO PLN 30.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY						 1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 30.15 vs   24.12</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   49.11 vs   36.51</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 75.14 vs   56.59</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     113.13 vs   83.43</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY					1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					174.26 vs  177.81</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				  270.02 vs  255.78</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		462.07 vs  392.42</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     721.72 vs  601.46</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank</p>
<p>Przemyslowo-Handlowy SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
